## Two polygons tagged by one AreaLightSource: one with a "P", one with
## only a "Cs". AGENTS.md's desync convention: AreaLightSource immediately
## precedes the polygons under test, and the block ends on a Sphere, so a
## mis-parsed parameter list desyncs it. Not third-party.
Display "arealight_polygon.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 64 64 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Surface "matte"
AttributeBegin
AreaLightSource "arealight" 1 "intensity" [10] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
Polygon "P" [-1 -1 0  1 -1 0  0 1 0]
Polygon "Cs" [1 0 0]
AttributeEnd
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
